          "source": "https://www.sbicard.com/sbi-card-en/assets/docs/pdf/cashback-tnc-booklet.pdf\n"
        },
        {
          "key": "interest_free_credit_period",
          "description": "The general SBI Card MITC states an interest-free credit period of 20–50 days for retail purchases when the previous month's outstanding balance is paid in full. This is distinct from the separate 3-day payment grace period.",
